StryveForms is a TypeScript rebuild of OpnForm (https://github.com/OpnForm/OpnForm),
Copyright (c) OpnForm, licensed under the GNU AGPL v3. StryveForms follows
OpnForm's data model (form fields, conditional logic, submissions and
integrations) so forms can be migrated between the two. No code from OpnForm's
separately licensed "api/app/Enterprise" directory is used.

Third-party components keep their own licenses.
